OL,3,APolice ban protests near 10 schools and
OL,4,Afive universities in Paris
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice in Paris have issued a five-day
OL,7,Fban on protests near 10 secondary
OL,8,Fschools and five universities as
OL,9,Fauthorities try to control weeks of
OL,10,Fblockades and violence at educational
OL,11,Fvenues in France.
OL,13,FThe order prohibits unauthorised
OL,14,Fgatherings or marches within 100m of
OL,15,Fthe sites from 16 to 20 November.
OL,17,FParis police chief Patrice Faure said
OL,18,Fthe ban was necessary due to "numerous
OL,19,Fdisruptions and blockades around
OL,20,Fcertain secondary schools and
OL,21,Festablishments of higher learning" and
OL,22,F"persistent violence".
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
