OL,3,APolice ban protests near 10 schools and
OL,4,Afive universities in Paris
OL,5,
OL,6,FA wave of protests began in France
OL,7,FSeptember over poor secondary school
OL,8,Fconditions, before spreading to
OL,9,Funiversities, workers and a
OL,10,F"yellow-vest" movement against the cost
OL,11,Fof living.
